## Questions to Ask Yourself

1. ✅ **Do I have an Integration Starter Kit agent available?**  
   → YES? → Use them to build the APIs  
   → NO? → Get one or hire contractor

2. ✅ **Can Integration agent provide REST API endpoints?**  
   → YES? → Perfect, I can build storefront around them  
   → NO? → Need to adjust approach

3. ✅ **Am I ready to deploy both to Adobe I/O?**  
   → YES? → Full integration possible  
   → NO? → Phase it - APIs first, UI later

---

## Red Flags (What Could Go Wrong)

⚠️ **Integration Agent doesn't provide endpoints** → Can't proceed with storefront  
⚠️ **API response format keeps changing** → Need stable contract  
⚠️ **No error handling in APIs** → Can't show user-friendly errors  
⚠️ **No CORS headers on endpoints** → Frontend can't call them  
⚠️ **Rate limiting on APIs** → Need to handle retries  

→ **Solution:** Get clarity on these BEFORE storefront development starts

---

